on mouseUp
  [  0] pushsymb 10 ............................. <#stop>
  [  2] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  5] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2>
  [  7] extcall 11 .............................. sound stop 2
  [  9] pushint8 8 .............................. <8>
  [ 12] pusharglist 1 ........................... <8>
  [ 14] extcall 4 ............................... <sprite(8)>
  [ 16] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 17] setobjprop 5 ............................ sprite(8).visible = 0
  [ 19] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 22] pusharglist 1 ........................... <14>
  [ 24] extcall 4 ............................... <sprite(14)>
  [ 26] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 29] setobjprop 5 ............................ sprite(14).visible = 1
  [ 31] pushcons 0 .............................. <"ett">
  [ 33] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"ett">
  [ 35] extcall 9 ............................... go("ett")
  [ 37] ret
end
